1) Read these rules:
   - `.cursor/rules/structure.mdc`, `copilot_tools.mdc`, `f arfalle_integration.mdc`, this file
2) Implement CRM adapter baseline
   - Create `adapters/crm/client.py` (login, CSRF, retry)
   - Create `adapters/crm/tools.py` with list_docs/get_doc/insert_doc/set_value
   - Test with curl equivalents in `CRM_API.md`
3) Add email tools
   - Implement email_draft/send (via `crm.api.agent.run`)
   - Verify draft surfaces at `/crm/human_inbox`
4) Add ETL tools
