   - Test using `scripts/fixtures/etl/*.csv`
5) Add voice
   - Create `adapters/twilio_vapi/*`; read Vapi/Twilio creds from env
   - Implement initiate_call(contact_id), capture transcript via Vapi webhook → Farfalle → CRM notes
6) Add KB helpers
   - Implement search/summarize over Notes/Communications
7) Tighten security/observability
   - Respect RBAC matrix; add audit logs; expose latency/error metrics

## Tests to Run / Evidence to Produce
- Unit tests (if added): `pytest farfalle-main/tests -v`, `pytest crm-deployment/tests -v`
- Manual E2E demos (recorded screenshots or logs):
  - Chat: “List top 10 Open leads” → URLs returned
  - Draft email for a lead; confirm in Human Inbox
  - Import small CSV; confirm leads created
  - Place a voice call to a test contact; note created; task scheduled
- Curl health checks (examples in `CRM_API.md`)

## Guardrails
- No schema migrations without approval
- Use existing whitelisted APIs; do not add guest endpoints
- Keep secrets in env files (never in code)
- Small PRs with clear diffs and instructions